        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Drift Survivors 2&quot; is the sequel to the acclaimed arcade game, now infused with roguelite elements. Upgrade your vehicle in intense battles and choose a gun that matches your style from random weapon drops! The online leaderboard is still there, challenging you to achieve higher scores in Endless Mode and make your mark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Enjoy improved controls, allowing you to drift with ease and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. While gamepads and keyboards capture the essence of action games, mouse input is also supported for a more accessible experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unlock a variety of vehicles and guns to create your perfect combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. In Normal Mode, enhance your vehicle with attribute upgrade cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stylized pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy-to-learn yet challenging drifting mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Powerful and unique enemies and bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Global leaderboard challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Thrilling collisions, shootings, and explosions!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Drift Survivors 2&quot; is the sequel to the acclaimed arcade game, now infused with roguelite elements. Upgrade your vehicle in intense battles and choose a gun that matches your style from random weapon drops! The online leaderboard is still there, challenging you to achieve higher scores in Endless Mode and make your mark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Enjoy improved controls, allowing you to drift with ease and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. While gamepads and keyboards capture the essence of action games, mouse input is also supported for a more accessible experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unlock a variety of vehicles and guns to create your perfect combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. In Normal Mode, enhance your vehicle with attribute upgrade cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stylized pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy-to-learn yet challenging drifting mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Powerful and unique enemies and bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Global leaderboard challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Thrilling collisions, shootings, and explosions!</p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Drift Survivor 2&quot; is a thrilling Roguelite vehicular combat game where you unleash bullets amidst chaotic drifts and high-speed chases. In each unpredictable battle, you must also manage energy consumption,choose different weapons, upgrade your vehicle, and ultimately defeat the powerful AI legion!",
